{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfS8VjYey836on1hwqMf5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS - All 21 tests passed (11 OrderControllerTest + 6 ShipmentControllerTest + 3 CustomerControllerTest + 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests)\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** - ./mvnw test succeeded with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** - All original tests still pass (customer, shipment baseline tests)\n3. ✅ **`POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels that order's `CREATED` shipments** - Test `cancel_order_cancels_created_shipments` verifies this\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** - Uses same ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404) pattern with ApiError envelope\n5. ✅ **A repeated cancel succeeds; a cancel blocked by a `CONFIRMED` shipment changes nothing; an unknown order is refused; a shipment for a cancelled order is refused** - Tests:\n   - `cancel_of_already_cancelled_order_succeeds` - idempotent\n   - `cancel_order_with_confirmed_shipment_fails_with_409_and_changes_nothing` - all-or-nothing\n   - `cancel_nonexistent_order_fails_with_404` - unknown order\n   - `rejects_shipment_creation_for_cancelled_order_with_409` - reject shipment creation\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** - No changes to pom.xml\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** - Only modified Order, OrderController, ShipmentRepository, ShipmentController, and ApiError\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Change | Necessary |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Order.kt | Added OrderStatus enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) and status field to Order data class | ✅ Yes - API contract requires GET to return status |\n| ApiError.kt | Added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED error code | ✅ Yes - needed for distinguishing cancel conflict cases |\n| ShipmentReposi